{
  "an10.62:0.1": "Aṅguttara Nikāya 10.62 ",
  "an10.62:0.2": "7. Yamakavagga ",
  "an10.62:0.3": "Taṇhāsutta ",
  "an10.62:1.1": "“Purimā, bhikkhave, koṭi na paññāyati bhavataṇhāya: ‘ito pubbe bhavataṇhā nāhosi, atha pacchā samabhavī’ti. ",
  "an10.62:1.2": "Evañcetaṁ, bhikkhave, vuccati, atha ca pana paññāyati: ‘idappaccayā bhavataṇhā’ti. ",
  "an10.62:2.1": "Bhavataṇhampāhaṁ, bhikkhave, sāhāraṁ vadāmi, no anāhāraṁ. ",
  "an10.62:2.2": "Ko cāhāro bhavataṇhāya? ",
  "an10.62:2.3": "‘Avijjā’tissa vacanīyaṁ. ",
  "an10.62:2.4": "Avijjampāhaṁ, bhikkhave, sāhāraṁ vadāmi, no anāhāraṁ. ",
  "an10.62:2.5": "Ko cāhāro avijjāya? ",
  "an10.62:2.6": "‘Pañca nīvaraṇā’tissa vacanīyaṁ. ",
  "an10.62:2.7": "Pañca nīvaraṇepāhaṁ, bhikkhave, sāhāre vadāmi, no anāhāre. ",
  "an10.62:2.8": "Ko cāhāro pañcannaṁ nīvaraṇānaṁ? ",
  "an10.62:2.9": "‘Tīṇi duccaritānī’tissa vacanīyaṁ. ",
  "an10.62:2.10": "Tīṇipāhaṁ, bhikkhave, duccaritāni sāhārāni vadāmi, no anāhārāni. ",
  "an10.62:2.11": "Ko cāhāro tiṇṇannaṁ duccaritānaṁ? ",
  "an10.62:2.12": "‘Indriyaasaṁvaro’tissa vacanīyaṁ. ",
  "an10.62:2.13": "Indriyaasaṁvarampāhaṁ, bhikkhave, sāhāraṁ vadāmi, no anāhāraṁ. ",
  "an10.62:2.14": "Ko cāhāro indriyaasaṁvarassa? ",
  "an10.62:2.15": "‘Asatāsampajaññan’tissa vacanīyaṁ. ",
  "an10.62:2.16": "Asatāsampajaññampāhaṁ, bhikkhave, sāhāraṁ vad